{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Whenever energy is transferred by a device, not all of it may reach the intended useful store. Friction between moving parts increases their internal energy stores. Electrical resistance causes wires and components to warm up when current flows. Warm buildings transfer energy to cooler surroundings. Some devices also transfer energy by sound when that sound is not useful.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 24.72, "words": [["Whenever", 0.102083], ["energy", 0.583875], ["is", 1.000541], ["transferred", 1.156791], ["by", 1.6125], ["a", 1.76875], ["device,", 1.859916], ["not", 2.641166], ["all", 2.940625], ["of", 3.096875], ["it", 3.240125], ["may", 3.422416], ["reach", 3.578666], ["the", 3.904166], ["intended", 3.995333], ["useful", 4.477083], ["store.", 4.88075], ["Friction", 6.132833], ["between", 6.653666], ["moving", 6.953125], ["parts", 7.317708], ["increases", 7.64325], ["their", 8.190125], ["internal", 8.385416], ["energy", 8.880208], ["stores.", 9.257833], ["Electrical", 10.742208], ["resistance", 11.380208], ["causes", 11.940125], ["wires", 12.291666], ["and", 12.617208], ["components", 12.786458], ["to", 13.372416], ["warm", 13.502625], ["up", 13.710958], ["when", 13.90625], ["current", 14.140625], ["flows.", 14.492208], ["Warm", 15.885416], ["buildings", 16.25], ["transfer", 16.692708], ["energy", 17.135416], ["to", 17.565125], ["cooler", 17.721375], ["surroundings.", 17.994791], ["Some", 19.726583], ["devices", 20.065125], ["also", 20.520833], ["transfer", 20.833333], ["energy", 21.276041], ["by", 21.71875], ["sound", 21.875], ["when", 22.200541], ["that", 22.421875], ["sound", 22.617208], ["is", 22.942708], ["not", 23.112], ["useful.", 23.346375]], "raw": [{"text": "Whenever", "start": 0.102083, "end": 0.505749}, {"text": "energy", "start": 0.583875, "end": 0.9745}, {"text": "is", "start": 1.000541, "end": 1.091707}, {"text": "transferred", "start": 1.156791, "end": 1.547416}